  {
   "start": 162.8,
   "end": 180.0,
   "title": "He Can Turn Off the Blond",
   "quote": "I'm sorry, does that make me girlish, or you manish? / Hah, that's hilarious. You talk like he fights.",
   "line_start": 60,
   "line_end": 65
  },
  {
   "start": 192.7,
   "end": 236.62,
   "title": "As Threatening as a Cocker Spaniel",
   "quote": "Roll it back, pint sized, we're not gonna fight you. You're about as threatening as a Cocker Spaniel. ... Hehe, that's cute. You're cute.",
   "line_start": 70,
   "line_end": 84
  },
  {
   "start": 236.5,
   "end": 251.72,
   "title": "You Got a Thing for Dwarves Now?",
   "quote": "Look, if this is about pissing off Mom 'n' Dad, you could just date a black guy. / Oh, my God. / Oh. Right. They're dead.",
   "line_start": 85,
   "line_end": 92
  },
  {
   "start": 251.8,
   "end": 277.24,
   "title": "He Believes Me... and He's Jealous",
   "quote": "I *don't* believe you. / I *can't* believe you. / I don't care. ... See? He believes me... ...and he's *jealous*!",
